Version: 1.0
desc: Head in the Clouds Algorithmic Reverb (Cloud Seed port) by chmaha
tags: reverb algorithmic ambient modulated delay diffusion
author: chmaha
changelog:
  Initial release.
about:
  A reverb for huge spaces, thick pads and modulated echoes. Input filtering and a multitap early section feed
  12 modulated delay lines per channel with their own diffusion and EQ. Every parameter of the Cloud Seed 2.0
  core is available, along with a Feedback Buffer setting. Clouds drift across the window and thicken with the
  reverb tail.
  Ported from Cloud Seed Core by Ghost Note Audio
  https://github.com/GhostNoteAudio/CloudSeedCore (MIT)
  Not created by or affiliated with Ghost Note Audio
  JSFX version released under MIT license
  Claude generated some of this code

